  attackName: Air Headbutt Dive
  domain: 1
  isLauncher: 0
  cooldownFrames: 0
  requiresAirborne: 1
  landingFrame: 14
  airborneHoldFrame: 13
  artworkNotes: 'Head-first special. 0-4 startup, 5-6 travel, 7-13 active (13 holds
    until landing), 14-16 impact, 17-23 recovery. Velocity5: forward6/down8; compact
    head hitbox. Ground contact branches directly to14. Events: DiveWindup, DiveWhoosh,
    DiveLanding. Edit all timings/physics/hits here.'
